      -- room_cost: $308.01
      -- local_taxes: $0.00
      -- mandatory_resort_or_city_charge: $0.00
      -- parking_cost: $0.00
      -- no_compliant_accommodation_available_evidenced: true
    }
  assertion r.applicable_cap = $308.00
  assertion r.accommodation_reimbursable = $308.00
```

## E4_2_NotEvidencedSameCost

The same £300 room without the evidence: the E-4.1 cap stands. A module that
inferred the judgement from the cost exceeding the cap would return £308 here.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestE4_2_NotEvidencedSameCost:
  output r content Accommodation.NightlyAccommodation

scope TestE4_2_NotEvidencedSameCost:
  definition r equals
    output of Accommodation.NightlyAccommodation with {
      -- city_tier: ExpenseDefs.CityTier.Tier1
      -- room_cost: $300.00
      -- local_taxes: $0.00
      -- mandatory_resort_or_city_charge: $0.00
      -- parking_cost: $0.00
      -- no_compliant_accommodation_available_evidenced: false
    }
  assertion r.applicable_cap = $220.00
  assertion r.accommodation_reimbursable = $220.00
```

